This repository provides reusable Agent Skills and application security
engineering references aligned with:
- Agent Skills specification (https://agentskills.io/)
- OWASP Top 10 (2021)
- OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS 4.0.3)
- OWASP API Security Top 10 (2023)
- OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS 2.1.0)
- OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications (2025) / OWASP GenAI Security Project
- CWE (MITRE) and NIST SSDF (1.1)

No third-party scanner binaries or runtime libraries are bundled in this
repository.
